  "description": "Enterprise-ready modular framework for .NET 8.0/9.0 with Clean Architecture. Features: BaseDbContext with audit/soft-delete/multi-tenancy, 88 organized interfaces across 17 domains, Repository/UnitOfWork patterns, CQRS with MediatR Behaviors (Validation, Logging, Transaction), Sagas, Event Sourcing, CDN integration, and comprehensive infrastructure services. Built with SOLID principles for scalable enterprise applications.",
